{"resource":{"id":"pe-learning-roadmap","title":"Prompt Engineering \u2014 Learning Roadmap","category":"AI & Data","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"8 min","pages":10,"lastUpdated":"April 2026","tags":["Prompt Engineering","Prompts","LLM"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A structured 12-week roadmap from zero to production Prompt Engineering \u2014 with weekly milestones, projects, certifications, career paths and readiness checkpoints."},"toc":[{"id":"prereq","label":"1. Prerequisites"},{"id":"ai","label":"2. Understanding AI & LLMs"},{"id":"fund","label":"3. Prompt Fundamentals"},{"id":"patterns","label":"4. Prompt Patterns"},{"id":"adv","label":"5. Advanced Prompting"},{"id":"agents","label":"6. AI Agents"},{"id":"rag","label":"7. RAG & Context Engineering"},{"id":"multi","label":"8. Multimodal Prompting"},{"id":"portfolio","label":"9. Portfolio Projects"},{"id":"career","label":"10. Career Preparation"},{"id":"review","label":"Roadmap Review"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Prompt Engineering \u2014 Frequently Asked Questions","tag":"AI & Data","time":"14 min"},{"title":"Prompt Engineering \u2014 Tips & Tricks","tag":"AI & Data","time":"10 min"},{"title":"Prompt Engineering \u2014 Reference Guide","tag":"AI & Data","time":"43 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Learn Prompt Engineering in the correct sequence \u2014 not by chasing tutorials.</li>\n          <li>Track progress with weekly milestones and readiness checkpoints.</li>\n          <li>Build a portfolio strong enough for a real AI-engineering interview.</li>\n          <li>Pick a career path (research, applied, product, DevRel).</li>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure\n          src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?w=1600&q=80\"\n          caption=\"12-week roadmap \u2014 beginner to production, one milestone per week.\"\n        />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"prereq\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Prerequisites</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Comfort with English writing.</li>\n          <li>Basic computer literacy (browsers, files, APIs).</li>\n          <li>Python or JavaScript at reading-level (helpful, not required for weeks 1\u20134).</li>\n          <li>Curiosity to test hypotheses instead of copying tutorials.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Zero-code start</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          You can complete weeks 1\u20134 in the ChatGPT / Claude / Gemini UI alone.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"ai\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Understanding AI &amp; LLMs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>What is a transformer? Tokens, attention, next-token prediction.</li>\n          <li>Frontier vs open models: GPT-4o, Claude 3.5, Gemini 2, Llama, Mistral.</li>\n          <li>Capabilities and limits: hallucination, context window, refusal, cost.</li>\n          <li>Sampling: temperature, top_p, penalties, stop sequences.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"fund\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Prompt Fundamentals</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Role \u00b7 Task \u00b7 Format (RTF) template.</li>\n          <li>System vs user vs assistant turns.</li>\n          <li>Zero / one / few-shot prompting.</li>\n          <li>Delimiters and clean instructions.</li>\n          <li>Length control and stop sequences.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"patterns\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Prompt Patterns</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Persona, recipe, template, flipped-interaction, cognitive verifier.</li>\n          <li>Chain-of-Thought, plan-then-solve.</li>\n          <li>Self-consistency and reflection.</li>\n          <li>ReAct interleaving reasoning and tool calls.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"adv\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Advanced Prompting</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Prompt optimisation: APE, OPRO, DSPy.</li>\n          <li>Constrained decoding + JSON schema.</li>\n          <li>Distilling long prompts into short + fine-tuned models.</li>\n          <li>LLM-as-judge and pairwise evaluation.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"agents\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. AI Agents</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Tool calling / function calling primitives.</li>\n          <li>Single-agent ReAct loops.</li>\n          <li>Planner\u2013executor and supervisor multi-agent patterns.</li>\n          <li>Budgeting steps, tokens, cost and wall time.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"rag\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. RAG &amp; Context Engineering</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Chunking strategies and embedding models.</li>\n          <li>Hybrid retrieval (BM25 + dense) with a reranker.</li>\n          <li>Grounded answers with citations and abstain logic.</li>\n          <li>Advanced: HyDE, CRAG, Self-RAG, GraphRAG.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"multi\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Multimodal Prompting</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Vision-language prompts (image \u2192 structured output).</li>\n          <li>Audio: streaming ASR feeding a text LLM.</li>\n          <li>Document AI: PDFs, tables, receipts, forms.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"portfolio\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Portfolio Projects</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"text-left p-2\">Project</th><th class=\"text-left p-2\">Stack</th><th class=\"text-left p-2\">Why it matters</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            {PROJECTS.map((p) => (\n              <tr key={p.name} class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">{p.name}</td><td class=\"p-2\">{p.stack}</td><td class=\"p-2\">{p.why}</td></tr>\n            ))}\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Portfolio rule of three</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          Ship three projects \u2014 one RAG, one agent, one integration. Each with a README, demo GIF and eval numbers.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"career\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Career Preparation</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Career paths</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>AI / LLM Engineer</strong> \u2014 ships prompt-driven systems in production.</li>\n          <li><strong>Applied Researcher</strong> \u2014 evaluates and improves models & pipelines.</li>\n          <li><strong>Prompt / DevRel Engineer</strong> \u2014 writes, teaches, evangelises.</li>\n          <li><strong>AI Product Manager</strong> \u2014 spec, evaluate, coordinate.</li>\n          <li><strong>Solutions Architect (AI)</strong> \u2014 designs enterprise deployments.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Certifications worth considering</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>DeepLearning.AI \u2014 ChatGPT Prompt Engineering, LangChain for LLM App Dev.</li>\n          <li>Google Cloud \u2014 Generative AI Leader / Engineer.</li>\n          <li>Microsoft \u2014 AI-102 Azure AI Engineer Associate.</li>\n          <li>AWS \u2014 AI Practitioner / ML Engineer Associate.</li>\n          <li>NVIDIA \u2014 Building Transformer-Based NLP Applications.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Interview preparation</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Whiteboard a RAG system end-to-end.</li>\n          <li>Debug a hallucinating prompt live.</li>\n          <li>Design a prompt evaluation pipeline.</li>\n          <li>Compare fine-tuning vs prompting vs RAG.</li>\n          <li>Explain a prompt-injection defence layer-by-layer.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"review\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Roadmap Review</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Progress tracker (12-week timeline)</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-2 space-y-2\">\n          {WEEKS.map((w) => (\n            <div key={w.w} class=\"rounded-md border p-3\">\n              <div class=\"font-semibold\">{w.w} \u2014 {w.focus}</div>\n              <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n                {w.tasks.map((t) => <li key={t}>{t}</li>)}\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n        <Figure\n          src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?w=1600&q=80\"\n          caption=\"Readiness checkpoints \u2014 one milestone per week keeps momentum without burnout.\"\n        />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Readiness checklist</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>You can explain tokens, attention and sampling in your own words.</li>\n          <li>You've built and evaluated a RAG system.</li>\n          <li>You've shipped an agent with tool calls and budgets.</li>\n          <li>You've published at least one project publicly with a README + eval.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Next learning steps</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Deep-dive into fine-tuning (LoRA, PEFT, DPO).</li>\n          <li>Learn one observability platform (LangSmith / Langfuse).</li>\n          <li>Contribute to an open-source LLM tool.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is 12 weeks realistic part-time?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes at ~8\u201310 hrs/week. Bump to 6 weeks full-time.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Which framework should I learn first?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">LangChain for exposure; DSPy once you've felt the pain of hand-tuned prompts.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Do I need a GPU?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No \u2014 you're calling APIs. GPUs only enter the picture for fine-tuning or self-hosting.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          This resource is intended for educational purposes only. Information is compiled from official documentation, academic publications, research papers, industry standards, and trusted educational resources. Prompt Engineering techniques, AI models, APIs, and best practices evolve continuously \u2014 consult official documentation for the latest information. All trademarks, product names, logos, and intellectual property belong to their respective owners.\n        </p>\n      </div></section>"}